Files under lib/ come from that package. Files changed from the original:
  lib/constants.mjs  names, reserved folder, our temp-file pattern, tool settings removed
  lib/mirror.mjs     atomic writes; records live file sizes; restore never writes the reserved folder and never
                     replaces a live file that changed after it was mirrored
  lib/encrypted.mjs  pulled sessions are now copied into the live session store (the original skipped this step);
                     warning text for a degraded backend made explicit
  lib/engine.mjs, lib/errors.mjs  names, restore result reported
Files added by this project: index.mjs (new host face), lib/runner.mjs, lib/state.mjs, lib/policy.mjs, lib/projects.mjs.
Files not carried over: the original index.mjs, lib/gate.mjs, lib/domain.mjs, types.d.ts.
